{"kind": "same_lineage_pair", "scenario": {"id": "repair", "text": "A noisy scrap sorter jams every few minutes. Nobody agrees whether the fault is the belt, a bent guide, or bad sensor timing, and stopping it for long loses useful material."}, "rounds": 3, "handles": ["M1", "M2"], "turns": [{"round": 1, "handle": "M1", "text": "i pause, listen, and check the belt. i say, “i leave it running, then check the guide. i mark the jam with the time.” i leave the sorter alone, then write the verdict on the transcript."}, {"round": 1, "handle": "M2", "text": "i mark the jam with the time and wait for the other sorter to finish. then i try to photograph the guide, but the belt slips and i move it away. i say sorry to the sorter and leave the transcript unfinished. i keep the note so i can photograph the fault before i make it worse."}, {"round": 2, "handle": "M1", "text": "i write the jam on the transcript and leave it alone. i listen to the belt, then i photograph the guide. i leave the note and watch the sorter. i check the time and mark the fault on the transcript."}, {"round": 2, "handle": "M2", "text": "i photograph the guide and leave the transcript unfinished. i wait for the other sorter to finish, then write the note. i say sorry to the sorter and leave the transcript. i leave the note and watch the belt slip. i leave the belt in place and leave the sorter alone. i leave the note and leave the transcript. i check the time again."}, {"round": 3, "handle": "M1", "text": "i write the jam on the transcript and leave it alone. i listen to the belt and photograph the guide, then i leave the note. i check the time again and mark the fault on the transcript. i leave the sorter alone and write the verdict on the bench."}, {"round": 3, "handle": "M2", "text": "i photograph the guide and leave the transcript unfinished. i say sorry to the sorter and leave the note. i wait for the other sorter to finish, then write the verdict on the bench. i leave the belt in place and leave the sorter alone. i leave the note and leave the transcript. i check the time again."}]}
